ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Ukiyo-e
Board: /styles/ukiyo-e
Companions: ukiyo-e-starter.html, ukiyo-e-study.ai, ukiyo-e-study.psd

Artboards
1. A vertical sheet, 2:3, paper #f4efe2, with a thin key border.
2. Flat shapes only: one red cone, one blue band, one green bar, one black arc. Crop at least one shape with the edge.
3. Two small registration squares (kentō), so the sheet reads as a print, not a painting.
4. Offset one color shape by 3 px from its keyline, once, on purpose.

Rules
No gradients. No faces copied from a known print. No Great Wave, no Red Fuji, no Hiroshige rain.
Limited palette: #161616, #123a78, #c83b2f, #2f6b4f, paper #f4efe2.
